{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50978","headline":"咏牡丹 · 王溥","name":"咏牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枣花至小能成实，桑叶虽柔解吐丝。\n堪笑牡丹如斗大，不成一事又空枝。\n（见《宋诗纪事》引《历代吟谱》。\n见明刻本《吟窗杂录》卷三十三《历代吟谱》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王溥","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}